{"id":"1281b74b358815ce","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization.md","title":"Hartogs界内稳定与最小不动点","display":"thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization — Hartogs界内稳定与最小不动点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization","aliases":["72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization"],"display":"thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization — Hartogs界内稳定与最小不动点","depends_on":["[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]","[[72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.9 monotone fixed-point theorem, print749/PDF761; local Hartogs-bounded completion of the argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization — Hartogs界内稳定与最小不动点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e85e168ce8db5c81\" href=\"?note=e85e168ce8db5c81\" title=\"72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison\">72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.9 monotone fixed-point theorem, print749/PDF761; local Hartogs-bounded completion of the argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\preceq,b,F\">\\(D,\\preceq,b,F\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(D)\">\\(\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:=J_{F,\\theta}\">\\(J:=J_{F,\\theta}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_F,u_F\">\\(\\kappa_F,u_F\\)</span> 在下式给出；固定点与前不动点均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_F:=\\min\\{\\alpha&lt;\\theta:J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)\\},\\qquad u_F:=J(\\kappa_F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\kappa_F:=\\min\\{\\alpha&lt;\\theta:J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)\\},\\qquad u_F:=J(\\kappa_F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nF(u_F)&amp;=u_F,\\\\\n\\forall z\\in D\\quad F(z)\\preceq z&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u_F\\preceq z,\\\\\n\\forall\\beta\\quad\\kappa_F\\le\\beta\\le\\theta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ J(\\beta)=u_F,\\\\\n\\forall u\\in D\\quad\n\\bigl(F(u)=u\\land\\forall z\\in D\\ (F(z)\\preceq z\\Rightarrow u\\preceq z)\\bigr)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u=u_F.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nF(u_F)&amp;=u_F,\\\\\n\\forall z\\in D\\quad F(z)\\preceq z&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u_F\\preceq z,\\\\\n\\forall\\beta\\quad\\kappa_F\\le\\beta\\le\\theta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ J(\\beta)=u_F,\\\\\n\\forall u\\in D\\quad\n\\bigl(F(u)=u\\land\\forall z\\in D\\ (F(z)\\preceq z\\Rightarrow u\\preceq z)\\bigr)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u=u_F.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\theta\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\)</span> 都不稳定，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(\\alpha)\\prec J(\\alpha+1)\">\\(J(\\alpha)\\prec J(\\alpha+1)\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\theta\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\theta\\)</span>，递增性与反对称性使两阶段不同，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\restriction\\theta\">\\(J\\restriction\\theta\\)</span> 单射进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>，违背Hartogs界。稳定阶段存在后，最小性来自序数良序，且后续阶段用超限归纳恒等于同一不动点；非零极限处的常尾链也具有相同上确界。前不动点比较给最小性。两个满足该性质的点互相小于等于，故唯一。该证明没有使用连续性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"e85e168ce8db5c81","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,\\preceq,b,F$ 如 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]；$\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(D)$，$J:=J_{F,\\theta}$。$\\kappa_F,u_F$ 在下式给出；固定点与前不动点均在 $D$ 中。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\preceq,b,F","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(D)","display":false},{"tex":"J:=J_{F,\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_F,u_F","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\alpha<\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa_F:=\\min\\{\\alpha<\\theta:J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)\\},\\qquad u_F:=J(\\kappa_F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nF(u_F)&=u_F,\\\\\n\\forall z\\in D\\quad F(z)\\preceq z&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u_F\\preceq z,\\\\\n\\forall\\beta\\quad\\kappa_F\\le\\beta\\le\\theta&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ J(\\beta)=u_F,\\\\\n\\forall u\\in D\\quad\n\\bigl(F(u)=u\\land\\forall z\\in D\\ (F(z)\\preceq z\\Rightarrow u\\preceq z)\\bigr)&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u=u_F.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"J(\\alpha)\\prec J(\\alpha+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\beta<\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"J\\restriction\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false}],"bytes":2202,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-485","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization|thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization — Hartogs界内稳定与最小不动点]]"},{"id":"48f27dd0a6718192","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J:=J_{F,\\omega}$、$u:=J(\\omega)$；一般稳定阶段 $u_F$ 取 [[72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization]]，使用同一 $D,\\preceq,b,F$。"},{"id":"f02662d03d2c1226","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J:=J_{F,\\mathfrak h(D)}$、$\\kappa_F,u_F$ 取 [[72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization]] 的同一 $D,\\preceq,b,F$ 实例。"},{"id":"64b08328ac145622","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5d95b8963194821b","e85e168ce8db5c81"]}